{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1554.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"4eed3d22e18ba9b38b6b624cb3e050921397a61f06db6272dd4831a919a15fdf","ja":"謎のメッセージカード","zh":"神秘的的留言卡","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1554.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"aed22a6b871d2efc40c0d10e9e1e0f55c37f3ba8bff26eea93704cd1f655edbd","ja":"スタジオまちがえちゃったのかな？\nでも、スタッフさんはいるし、カメラも回ってるよね？","zh":"是走错摄影棚了吗？\n可是，工作人员都在，摄像机也开着呢吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1554.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"00d336ba68e7948b856ff016eadc7eaefa68966505e115a5e0b513a5b164b272","ja":"わかったわ！　さてはこれ、ドッキリね！\nやられたわ～！　すっかり驚かされちゃったわね！","zh":"我明白了！难不成这是整蛊吧！\n真有你的～！完全被吓到了呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1554.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"d5948965b33091e7ad984276006f11f58713110e7c303b7a643dcecb6592cbd3","ja":"なるほど！　……でも、「ドッキリ大成功～！」\nみたいなネタばらしが、出てくる気配がありませんね？","zh":"原来如此！……不过，完全没有要揭晓\n“整蛊大成功～！”的气氛呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1554.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"d6303538ea01ce87bd4da15dd82ca5d59f9850f36242d542ec5617f86a91cdd0","ja":"おや？　封筒が落ちてますよ。\n「中身を見てください」って、書いてます。","zh":"哎呀？地上掉了一封信呢。\n上面写着“请看信的内容”。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1554.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"290d3a575e65d9b773c828c21ef9a836038da594722906fcb8c0f3ff9aae65ea","ja":"中身は……メッセージカード、かな？\n「この謎を解いて、書いてる場所へ向かえ！」……？","zh":"里面的东西是……留言卡吗？\n“解开这个谜题，前往上面写着的地方！”……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1554.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"f572019770cd92322be2dc6790d356e7938a41459a5b16948cb4eaf5900006c1","ja":"どうやら、ドッキリの続きがあるみたいね。","zh":"看来恶作剧还有后续呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1554.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"9578a16202f3963c8b6b31660c7cb5e9ce48ac1525d56632b4e51798f269d52b","ja":"細かい紙がたくさん入ってるわね……。\nこれ、パズルになってるみたい。","zh":"里面装了好多细小的碎纸呢……\n这看起来像是拼图。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1554.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"20bcb71bcbb31b5444c1b4b275fbd116925bf7c2c132fa6da9888260775d131d","ja":"合わせたら、文字になるんじゃないかな？","zh":"拼在一起的话，是不是就能变成字了？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1554.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"2e94b8d4af45ff8cc8fa41b592ccf7ee6ef18e1a0d9ded2113586413bdc9b336","ja":"じゃあ、さっそく解いてみようよ。\nえっと……最初の文字は赤い紙かな？","zh":"那我们赶快来解开看看吧。\n我想想……第一个文字是在红色的纸上吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1554.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"cf95beef4adc254be365d8a8fb2bbffe07dc2ed3b2375fd855ef6afca5ca6598","ja":"これとこれとこれを組み合わせて……。","zh":"把这个、这个，还有这个组合起来……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1554.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"fe982c74462c34ff7257ca9ee11676a8eacda17b4a1666744b0949880eab2d46","ja":"最後の文字はこれとこれとこれで、\n他のふたつと組み合わせると……『ホ・ル・テ』？","zh":"最后的文字是这个、这个和这个，\n再和另外两个组合起来的话……“福尔特”？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1554.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"a4134c9286f60a4fb15ba18205492f77f567afc48851fcabbe043dbb188eb60a","ja":"青色と黄色が逆なのかも？　いれかえて\nうらがえしたら……ホテルの地図が描いてあるよ♪","zh":"蓝色和黄色可能反过来了？对调一下\n再翻过来的话……上面画着酒店的地图哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1554.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"cb895887db7eced09960566279be68393bf5b0c1659e1783427d2d944e0eef84","ja":"そこのラウンジなら、行ったことあるわ！\nさぁ、みんな行きましょ♪","zh":"那个休息室的话，我去过哦！\n来，大家一起去吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1554.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"52e4e7162bc8fdfca7a6d0ff3fce24fba490413fc1f32cccd3ccf1cbed681d93","ja":"ふう、やっと着いた～。\nここでいいんだよね？","zh":"呼，终于到了～。\n是这里没错吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1554.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"d0b28ccdbb3aa244ec2a0154ca7d7dfb826dc95b781807cb4972634780d20362","ja":"うん、スタッフさんや、\n共演者のみなさんもいるから……。","zh":"嗯，还有工作人员和\n其他共演的各位在……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1554.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"28150ef2a8971f2c2ea2c89bd2b6035cc0c8dc01a78f200aea672b98ca17b3f3","ja":"パンッ！　パンッ！　パパンッ！\nパチパチパチパチ～！！","zh":"啪！　啪！　啪啪！\n啪啪啪啪啪～！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1554.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"6212a4c22100c7d40fdb38af5f4a4ee663cba8a67dae9bfb539db66d4ba05f90","ja":"えっ、く、クラッカーと拍手～っ！？\nな、何事ですか～っ！？","zh":"诶，拉、拉炮和掌声～！？\n到、到底是怎么回事啊～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
